  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced. Thinly slice the onion. Strip the thyme leaves, discarding the tough stems. Crush or finely chop the garlic. Crumble 1 stock cube into a heatproof jug, add 125ml (½ cup) boiling water and stir to dissolve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/3841457/photos/large/62648_1-1b8a08d15e3e70be390edb998d96370b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast tomatoes and onion: Put the tomatoes, onion, garlic and thyme in a 1L (4 cup) baking dish. Drizzle with 1 tbs olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat. Roast on the upper oven shelf for 20 mins or until tender.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/3841460/photos/large/62648_2-9530e6083c7968759ae9ee5a540f1707.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake baguette: Meanwhile, halve the baguette lengthwise. Put on an oven tray, cut-side up, and bake on the lower shelf for 6-8 mins until golden and crunchy.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/3841464/photos/large/62648_3-83cd1d6a461c2e0fb103d66e97c14b4c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make soup: Transfer the roast tomato mixture to a medium saucepan. Add the stock and half the coconut milk and blend with a stick blender until almost smooth (see Make it yours). Bring the soup to a simmer over medium heat, then remove the pan from the heat. Taste, then season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/3841473/photos/large/62648_4-7a642b8f2989485475eb5db4b3c4ca08.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the soup among bowls and serve with the baguette for dipping. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/3841477/photos/large/62648_5-5a34a6fa79c4270081b4915f76b7bfb8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Like it chunky or don't have a blender? Simply mash the roast tomato mixture with a fork instead of blending.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/3841485/photos/large/62648_6-140f0a3d97edb27edd67ae1988c6ed2b.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
